      "id": "claim_6ad528a318bf4e039802695279e99d88",
      "statement": "dcode resolves the main-agent recursion limit through managed configuration, CLI, environment, and config.toml precedence, then inherits LANGGRAPH_DEFAULT_RECURSION_LIMIT when no Deep Agents setting wins; managed, environment, and TOML values are bounded to [25, 100,000], while the CLI accepts any non-boolean integer at least 1.",
