      "id": "claim_a82286df62e2449299a3187a5bbc8e97",
      "statement": "The backend protocol uses a 15-second sync grep phase budget and a 35-second async grep wrapper timeout; when the async wrapper times out it returns a model-readable GrepResult error advising a narrower pattern or path, so the timeout is a recoverable tool result rather than a required run failure.",
